      "id": "int-problem",
      "text": "Meta Muse Spark Open (816B parameters in total, 42B active per token) is to be run for inference on an NVIDIA DGX Spark (128 GB configuration). The sources state that the model card gives 700 GB of VRAM required at NVFP4 (2000 GB at BF16), while the machine has 128 GB of nominal unified memory shared by CPU and GPU with no separate GPU memory, and the target proposes an 80 GB memory budget for the engine.",
