    {
      "id": "con-memory-budget",
      "text": "Pass/fail memory budget of 80 GB (decimal) in the unified pool mem0, counting everything the engine's container holds in the pool at any moment: process allocations on CPU and GPU and page cache attributable to the files it reads. The figure, unit basis and accounting boundary are proposals to be confirmed.",
